<div class="fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-40">
    <button onclick="openAiAssistantModal()"
        class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-amber-700 hover:to-indigo-700 text-white font-bold px-4 py-3 rounded-full shadow-lg flex items-center gap-2.5 transition transform hover:scale-105">
        <span class="text-lg">✨</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm">Konsultasi Menu AI (Gemini)</span>
    </button>
</div>

<div id="aiModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm hidden items-center justify-center p-4 z-50">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl w-full max-w-md p-6 shadow-2xl">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span>✨</span> Konsultasi Porsi & Menu AI
            </h3>
            <button onclick="closeAiModal()"
                class="text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-600 text-2xl font-bold">&times;</button>
        </div>
        <div class="py-4 text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            <p>Wadah integrasi <strong>Google Gemini API</strong> Asisten AI siap membantu pemilihan menu dan simulasi
                kebutuhan porsi.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-3">
            <textarea id="aiPromptInput" rows="3"
                class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-xl p-3 text-xs focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500 focus:outline-none"
                placeholder="Contoh: 'Saya ada acara tasyakuran 25 orang budget 400 ribu, rekomendasikan menu yang pas!'"></textarea>
            <button onclick="alert('GEMINI_API_KEY di .env on progress.')"
                class="w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-amber-600 text-white py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold shadow">
                Tanyakan ke Gemini AI
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>